84ac3d4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\n应用容器 `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` 内部的业务逻辑依赖不可用（Logging fact `fact-0ae3eade979c` 明确报错 `dependency unavailable`），导致应用在处理就绪探针请求（或相关业务请求）时返回 HTTP 503 状态码。Kubernetes 检测到此状态后，将 Pod 的 `Ready` 条件置为 `False`，从而阻止流量进入。\n\n**证据不足/未确认部分：**\n1.  **具体是哪个依赖服务（Service/Endpoint）不可用**：当前日志仅记录了“依赖不可用”的通用错误信息，缺乏指向特定上游服务、数据库或配置项的细节事实。\n2.  **应用返回 503 的具体业务逻辑条件**：虽然确认了是业务代码行为，但未展示引发该错误的详细堆栈或触发条件。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 90.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6: 90.6s (Evidence 83.4s, RCA 7.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 124.058, "metrics": {"run_id": "e44a8ed7751a49a1", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 124.06258726119995, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "d